,"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: v4.5.beta1.official [46c495ca2], v4.5.dev5.official [64b09905c], v4.5.dev4.official [209a446e3]\n- Reproducible only on `macOS`\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.beta1 - macOS Sequoia (15.5.0) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Metal (Forward+) - integrated Apple M1 Pro (Apple7) - Apple M1 Pro (10 threads) - 16.00 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nEmbedded game window does not respect the custom mouse cursor image set either in code or in project settings. It works fine in non-embedded game windows.\n\nFollow-up issue for #107819 \n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Open the MRP\n- Make sure \"Embed game on next play\" is **on** (floating or not)\n- Observe custom cursor image is not showing up as it does with \"Embed game on next play\" is **off**\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[mrp-embed-custom-cursor.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20850309/mrp-embed-custom-cursor.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107827/reactions","total_c